\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Theorem~A exact Dicke-state moments across system sizes $M'$ and resonance branches. (a)~Exact kurtosis $\kappa _4 \le 3$ achieves a $4\times $ improvement over the Hoeffding bound $\kappa _4 \le 12$ of~\cite  {AKN26}, attaining equality uniquely at $(M', n, l) = (4, 2, 2)$ (orange diamond). (b)~Exact normalized sixth moment $\kappa _6 < 15$ ($8\times $ sharper than $120$) and orthogonal-projection variance $\kappa _6 - \kappa _4^2 < 6$.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:moments}{{1}{5}{Theorem~A exact Dicke-state moments across system sizes $M'$ and resonance branches. (a)~Exact kurtosis $\kappa _4 \le 3$ achieves a $4\times $ improvement over the Hoeffding bound $\kappa _4 \le 12$ of~\cite {AKN26}, attaining equality uniquely at $(M', n, l) = (4, 2, 2)$ (orange diamond). (b)~Exact normalized sixth moment $\kappa _6 < 15$ ($8\times $ sharper than $120$) and orthogonal-projection variance $\kappa _6 - \kappa _4^2 < 6$}{figure.1}{}}
